            See the full <a href="/docs/no-sdk-setup/" class="text-primary underline">No-SDK Setup guide</a> for complete Fluent Bit configuration.
            For ARM64/Raspberry Pi, use <code class="bg-muted px-1 rounded">cr.fluentbit.io/fluent/fluent-bit:4.2.2</code>.
          </p>
        </TabsContent>

        <TabsContent value="otel" class="space-y-4">
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
            Use OpenTelemetry for vendor-neutral instrumentation:
          </p>
          <Code lang="bash" theme="one-dark-pro" code={otelInstallCode} />
