          <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">
            See the full <a href="/docs/opentelemetry/" class="text-primary underline">OpenTelemetry guide</a> for Python, Go, and collector setup.
          </p>
        </TabsContent>
      </Tabs>
    </div>
